        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Ethylene, pipeline system, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Ethylene, pipeline system, at plant
Data are from the Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry (PlasticsEurope). Not included are the values reported for: recyclable wastes, amount of air / N2 / O2 consumed, unspecified metal emission to air and to water, mercaptan emission to air, unspecified CFC/HCFC emission to air, dioxin to water. The amount of "sulphur (bonded)" is assumed to be included into the amount of raw oil.;
CAS number: 000074-85-1; 
Synonyms: ethene, Ethan; 
UUID: ada054d4-788d-3c16-aefb-e280c49a807b
Aggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: European production sites along the pipline
Technology: product out of steam cracking of naphtha
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature values based on company survey 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ada054d4-788d-3c16-aefb-e280c49a807b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
